abstract: "Notebooks, a browser-based lab and a dashboard for the IEEE CARS 2026 workshop (organised by the Center for Cyber Security Research, University of North Dakota, Grand Forks, ND, USA, 28 October 2026) on explainable artificial intelligence in medical systems, covering interpretable models, explanation methods and their evaluation, attacks on medical AI with XAI-based analysis, and governance."
